{"name":"-56-6-0","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2021white_GriffinSPAWAR","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_21winter_avg_pathfinder","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Aliana closes her eyes. Although the events are long in the past, the memories feel like yesterday for her."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Operation Couatl is only listed as an ordinary decapitation operation in our files now."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Aliana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The operation itself is meaningless."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The location is what's important."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I remember it took place in a skyscraper, but you're right, nobody mentioned the location."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Aliana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, it was a skyscraper."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, it was in the Red Zone."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Also, it was a \"floating\" skyscraper."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"},{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you mind if I bring 15 and Dandelion in?"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This information you're revealing might be of the utmost importance to our upcoming operations."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-SCAR-L","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Aliana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Alright."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"2021summer_SecurityBureau","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Berlin, in the Stasi Office."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"K and J are sitting in the meeting room, staring blankly at the files before them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Have you ever heard of \"Daybreak\" squad?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, they were under the Army Special Warfare Command. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I think they were the product of the \"NGAD\" Project back then."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That was a period of frenzied competition in the arms industry. When you think about it, a lot of research fields stagnated after WW3 ended. Doll designs from back then aren't that far behind from the ones we have now."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I checked the files. Not much technology survived from WW3 and information about many secret projects and operations were lost."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Either they were lost in one contaminated zone or another, or some multi-sided conflict meant the data couldn't be backed up in time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"In short, you think this Doll is special, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Think more carefully about this. This was one of the jobs assigned to that spy that Soviet Statesec picked up during their internal purge."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wait a minute... Do you still remember that incident earlier when the \"Elmo\" was detained?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Of course, I handled it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I remember you said something about them being held because they were trafficking in illegal technology or something, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Now that you mention it, they were transporting a special container labelled \"NGAD\"!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Since it was a squad, there's got to be more than one Doll involved."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Looks like we can go ask an old friend to help us out."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Rather than those vague traces of movement in the Hauptbahnhof that Q gave us, if the Commander's made progress in restoring their facilities, they might have a way to contact each other!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"J gets up and prepares to leave the meeting room."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wait."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Keven","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"J","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What now?"}]}]},{"sprite